---
/**
 * Callout for the Stevens Pass Academic Excellence Program (AEP): free
 * Stevens Pass season passes for Cascade School District students who met
 * their school's academic goals the previous school year.
 * Review each fall; Stevens Pass renews the program year to year.
 */
import HighlightCallout from './ui/HighlightCallout.astro';
---

<HighlightCallout
  title="Stevens Pass Academic Excellence Program"
  icon="school"
  link="https://www.cascadesd.org/o/alp/page/stevens-pass-academic-excellence-program"
  linkLabel="Program details at cascadesd.org"
>
  <p>
    Stevens Pass offers <strong>free season passes to Cascade School District students who meet academic
    goals</strong> set by their school. For 2026–27, eligibility is based on goals from the 2025–26 school year
    (for example, AR points, Lexia units, or a designated assignment at Alpine Lakes).
  </p>
  <p>
    Each school decides eligibility and sends its list to Stevens Pass. To order, email
    <a href="mailto:SPGroups@vailresorts.com" class="underline">SPGroups@vailresorts.com</a> or visit the Season
    Pass Office; you'll need a photo of the student and a release signed by a parent or guardian. Questions
    about eligibility go to your school's principal.
  </p>
</HighlightCallout>
